  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Trong mỗi khoảng thời gian, giá trị đại diện là trung bình cộng của giá trị hai đầu mút nên ta có bảng sau:\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Thời gian</td><td>Số học sinh nam</td><td>Số học sinh nữ</td></tr><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>6</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>8</mn></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>13</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>9</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>11</mn></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>7</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>8</mn></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n\t\t\tTổng số học sinh nam là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Thời gian ngủ trung bình của học sinh nam là:\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>45</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>587</mn><mn>90</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>52</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">(giờ)</mtext><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tTổng số học sinh nữ là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>41</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Thời gian ngủ trung bình của học sinh nữ là:\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>41</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>555</mn><mn>82</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>77</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">(giờ)</mtext><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo>&gt;</mo><mover><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> nên thời gian ngủ trung bình của các bạn học sinh nữ lớn hơn thời gian ngủ trung bình của các bạn nam.</li><li>Tổng số học sinh được điều tra là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>41</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>86</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Giả sử <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>86</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> là dãy giá trị được sắp xếp theo thứ tự không giảm.<br>Ta có bảng sau:\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Thời gian</td><td>Số học sinh</td></tr><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>18</mn></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>23</mn></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>20</mn></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>15</mn></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n\t\t\tTứ phân vị thứ nhất <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>22</mn></msub></semantics></math>. Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>22</mn></msub></semantics></math> thuộc nhóm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên nhóm này chứa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>;</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và ta có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>86</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>18</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>203</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>64</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">(giờ)</mtext><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tNghĩa là có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi>%</mi></mrow></semantics></math> học sinh khối <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>11</mn></semantics></math> ngủ ít hơn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow></semantics></math> giờ.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>75</mn><mi>%</mi></mrow></semantics></math> học sinh khối <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>11</mn></semantics></math> ngủ ít nhất <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow></semantics></math> giờ.</li></ol>",
